A footnote definition's block runs to the end of its body

```
- a
  [^f]: t

    more
tail

x[^f]
.
<ul>
  <li>a</li>
</ul>
<p>tail</p>
<p>x<a id="fnref1" href="#fn1" role="doc-noteref"><sup>1</sup></a></p>
<section role="doc-endnotes" aria-label="Footnotes">
  <hr>
  <ol>
    <li id="fn1">
      <p>t</p>
      <p>more<a href="#fnref1" role="doc-backlink" aria-label="Back to reference">↩</a></p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
```

```
- a
  [r]: /u

    more
tail

[r][]
.
<ul>
  <li><p>a</p>
    <p>more
tail</p>
  </li>
</ul>
<p><a href="/u">r</a></p>
```
